  "question": {
    "text": "The number of integral points on the circle, touching the parabola <math><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><mi>x</mi></math> at <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> and passing through <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo></math> are equal to"
  },
